        task: "Write triage decisions for four patients with low back pain: (1) a 35-year-old warehouse worker with pain after lifting and no other symptoms, (2) a 62-year-old with breast cancer history and constant thoracic pain, (3) a 40-year-old with new saddle numbness and difficulty urinating, (4) a 28-year-old with a fever who injects drugs. For each, state treat vs refer, urgency, and your reasoning.",
