        task: "Write a clinic emergency action protocol for suspected MI, PE, stroke, and ruptured AAA. For each, list the warning signs (including atypical MI symptoms in women and older adults), the immediate steps staff should take, and what information to give EMS. Add a separate same-day-referral procedure for suspected DVT.",
