        task: "A 47-year-old direct-access patient has left shoulder pain with normal shoulder testing, and she reports increased fatigue and breathlessness climbing stairs over the past month. Decide whether to treat, refer, or treat and refer, and how urgently. Write a referral letter to her primary care physician using SBAR, and document the screening in your evaluation note.",
